{
	title: 'Solid on the newest 2.0 release',
	spec: 'The web client uses the latest SolidJS 2 runtime with its matching @solidjs/compiler. The Bun plugin compiles TSX directly without introducing Vite; the compiler is loaded only when serving the web page, so the host stays usable without it. Keep the compiler and runtime in sync on upgrades. The user checks the web UI after an upgrade; do not keep tests for temporary compiler/runtime incompatibilities.',
