	notes: [
		'2026-09-29: Tried SolidJS 2.0.0-rc.11 (@solidjs/web and @solidjs/signals rc.11) with newest published @dom-expressions/compiler 0.50.0-next.44. Browser CDP regression passed rc.8 and failed rc.11: onInput does not enable Send (delegated event silently missing). Keep rc.8 pinned until the compiler emits the delegated-event key rc.11 expects; the CDP test checks onInput and onClick in a real browser.',
		'2026-09-29: Supersedes the earlier rc.11 failure: the old experiment paired the Solid 2 runtime with the legacy @dom-expressions/compiler, which still emits the previous delegated-event key. Switched to @solidjs/compiler 2.0.0-rc.11 and the matching solid-js, @solidjs/web and signals rc.11. Its compiled JSX emits the new _$$ event key; existing project tests pass except recurring load-sensitive timing budgets. The user will manually check the web UI. Removed the historical event-specific CDP assertions.'
	]
